  "notes": "SBP EasyData API, Gold and Foreign Exchange Reserves of Pakistan. 19 series, Million USD, one row per series per date (long format; series_code identifies the series). Annual values (30 June) 1948-1970, partial 1971, month-end from 1972; series have different spans (fixed table in the loader). Data kept as returned: Z00060 (Total Liquid FX Reserves) and Z00070 (Total Reserve Assets) end at 2024-09 and are not derived; consumers can rebuild them as Z00060 = Z00030 + Z00050 and Z00070 = Z00010 + Z00020 + Z00040 (checked wherever all parts exist, tolerance 1). Negative values are real in Z00018 and Z00040. Re-queryable, but SBP may revise or remove data without notice, so each run's raw responses are kept (append_only_snapshot); revisions and status-only changes against the previous run are logged as warnings. EasyData returns the latest revised values, not first-release vintages. Series names have leading dots and spaces removed in processed; interim keeps them as returned. published_at = 25th of the month after observation_date 23:59:59 Asia/Karachi in UTC (basis bop_release_25th_next_month).",
